Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:06.51,LLFC,,0,0,0,,This film examines the\Ndevelopment of a modern theme park
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:10.12,LLFC,,0,0,0,,featuring unusually\Nrealistic attractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:14.75,LLFC,,0,0,0,,A wealthy businessman develops\Nan ambitious new entertainment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:19.25,LLFC,,0,0,0,,facility combining family\Nrecreation, scientific innovation,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:23.44,LLFC,,0,0,0,,and several animals previously\Nconsidered unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:26.23,LLFC,,0,0,0,,Before opening, all essential
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:29.08,LLFC,,0,0,0,,systems are carefully inspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.09,0:00:31.74,LLFC,,0,0,0,,The fences are secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:34.16,LLFC,,0,0,0,,The gates are locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:36.13,LLFC,,0,0,0,,And the electrical supply
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:39.03,LLFC,,0,0,0,,is expected to continue existing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:43.24,LLFC,,0,0,0,,A minor staffing matter leads\Nto a temporary reduction in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:46.96,LLFC,,0,0,0,,electricity, communications,\Nand the traditional
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.97,0:00:50.39,LLFC,,0,0,0,,distinction between\Nattractions and visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:55.26,LLFC,,0,0,0,,The project successfully\Ndemonstrates that prehistoric life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.27,0:00:56.80,LLFC,,0,0,0,,can be recreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.14,LLFC,,0,0,0,,It also provides valuable\Nevidence that commercial viability
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.15,0:01:03.36,LLFC,,0,0,0,,and scientific possibility are
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.37,0:01:05.66,LLFC,,0,0,0,,not always close relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:10.72,LLFC,,0,0,0,,Several useful lessons have\Ntherefore been identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:15.08,LLFC,,0,0,0,,Traditional attractions\Ninclude Ferris wheels,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:17.72,LLFC,,0,0,0,,carousels, and park trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.73,0:01:19.78,LLFC,,0,0,0,,Dinosaurs should generally be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:22.89,LLFC,,0,0,0,,considered an advanced\Nmanagement option.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:25.44,LLFC,,0,0,0,,Modern facilities depend
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.45,0:01:28.25,LLFC,,0,0,0,,on reliable electrical systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.26,0:01:32.29,LLFC,,0,0,0,,This is particularly important\Nwhen electricity is the main
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.30,0:01:35.13,LLFC,,0,0,0,,reason the visitors\Nare not being eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.64,0:01:39.32,LLFC,,0,0,0,,Employees should receive\Nappropriate support, clear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.33,0:01:42.89,LLFC,,0,0,0,,communication, and\Nadequate compensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:46.12,LLFC,,0,0,0,,A dissatisfied employee\Nmay reduce morale,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.13,0:01:48.45,LLFC,,0,0,0,,productivity, and the number
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:51.07,LLFC,,0,0,0,,of functioning electric fences.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.59,0:01:55.75,LLFC,,0,0,0,,The ability to do something does\Nnot necessarily mean that it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:56.86,LLFC,,0,0,0,,should be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.87,0:02:00.81,LLFC,,0,0,0,,This principle is useful in\Nscience, business, and the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:04.54,LLFC,,0,0,0,,management of large\Ncarnivorous attractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.06,0:02:08.22,LLFC,,0,0,0,,This concludes today's programme.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:12.51,LLFC,,0,0,0,,Please remain calm, follow\Nall posted instructions,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:15.66,LLFC,,0,0,0,,and avoid unnecessary innovation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:17.29,LLFC,,0,0,0,,Distribution of future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:20.20,LLFC,,0,0,0,,materials requires subscription.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:22.77,LLFC,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your attention.
